{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21386","headline":"和友封题开善寺十韵 · 元稹","name":"和友封题开善寺十韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"梁王开佛庙，云构岁时遥。\n珠缀飞闲鸽，红泥落碎椒。\n灯笼青焰短，香印白灰销。\n古匣收遗施，行廊画本朝。\n藏经沾雨烂，魔女捧花娇。\n亚树牵藤阁，横查压石桥。\n竹荒新笋细，池浅小鱼跳。\n匠正琉璃瓦，僧锄芍药苗。\n旋蒸茶嫩叶，偏把柳长条。\n便欲忘归路，方知隐易招。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21386.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21386","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}